{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、お笑いたくさんやってるけど\n本当に面白い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年、年末の楽しみなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いましょう笑いましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスの残り香。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のクリスマスは\nホールのケーキを買わなかったから\nクリスマス付近に頂いた差し入れたち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしかった～(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1枚目の写メの可愛いプリンは\nクリスマス当日にあった\n撮影で頂いたものです＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Cool-Up Girlsさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん、玲香、らり、愛未と！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"94年組だよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売近くなったら\nまた言うね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてその日はそのまま\n真夏とご飯行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん喋った～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はそんなクリスマスでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどんなクリスマスでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は京都個別！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生で一番失敗した買い物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月1日になった瞬間、何してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年最後の握手会\n待ってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/27/8364822/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}